+  /// exactly what a `Pressable`'s `locationX` / `locationY` give you.
+  ///
+  /// The rotation, mirroring and aspect-fill crop maths is left to
+  /// `AVCaptureVideoPreviewLayer` (this view's `layerClass`, see above): it already knows
+  /// the connection's video orientation, whether the camera is mirrored, and how
+  /// `videoGravity = .resizeAspectFill` crops the sensor. Hand-written x/y swapping gets
+  /// at least one of those wrong, and a wrong point of interest silently focuses on the
+  /// wrong part of the frame.
+  /// Exposure compensation in EV, coming from the `exposureBias` prop. `nil` means "no
+  /// compensation" and is treated as 0.
+  ///
